def Xform "CellTray_18650_2x2" (
    prepend apiSchemas = ["PhysicsRigidBodyAPI", "PhysicsMassAPI", "PhysxRigidBodyAPI"]
    doc = "PLA kitting tray for four 18650 cells, 80 x 80 x 14 mm: four round pockets r9.6 (0.6 mm radial clearance), 11 mm deep on a 3 mm floor, 1 mm 45 deg lead-in, on a 36 mm pitch (pockets at +-18, +-18 mm). Origin at the bottom face's centre. Colliders/: a floor box and 24 convex wedges per pocket (a 24-sided bore)."
